WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.120
At 9:07 this morning, we
experienced a partial shutdown.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.880
So, it's a cyber attack.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.320
I think I might've found
something.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.800
Saara, one of our work
experience students

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.480
found it.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.600
Do we know who's responsible?

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.480
Russia. Most likely FSB.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.240
I'd like to know what we could
do to retaliate.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:29.280
If we attack them again, it's
just an ever-escalating spiral.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.520
Surely it has to stop.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.040
This country has faced an attack
amounting to an act of war.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.320
It is our duty to respond.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.520
I have decided to declare a
state of emergency.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.120
Where's Putin going with this?

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.800
He wants to overturn
the world order.

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:52.840
Did we organize that
counterdemonstration?

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:55.280
We organized both of them.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:01.760
What if the other side
has already predicted

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.840
every step you will take?

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.360
They hit us again, we
up the stakes another notch.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.080
And before you know it,
we're into a cycle of

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.680
escalation and a catastrophic
loss of life.

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:18.160
There's been a massive leak of
data from GCHQ.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.600
This is far worse than
anything by Snowden.

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:25.480
Truth is they've been one step
ahead of us.

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:28.000
Anticipated how we would
react to every stage.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:37.480
Shut it down.

